{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cfbm3ZXGnBxUNVAtKWMhe", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "`git rebase --onto` moves a range of commits onto a new base. You choose exactly which commits move and where they go. A plain `git rebase` can't do that.\n\n## Syntax\n\n```\ngit rebase --onto <newbase> <upstream> [<branch>]\n```\n\n- **`<upstream>`**: commits after this point get moved. This point itself stays put.\n- **`<branch>`**: the last commit to move. It defaults to the current branch.\n- **`<newbase>`**: where the moved commits are replayed.\n\nPut simply, it takes the commits in `upstream..branch` and replays them on top of `newbase`.\n\n## Example: moving a branch off another feature branch\n\nYou branched `feature-b` from `feature-a`, but `feature-b` should have been based on `main`:\n\n```\nmain:       A---B\n                 \\\nfeature-a:        C---D\n                       \\\nfeature-b:              E---F\n```\n\nYou want only `E` and `F` on top of `main`, without `C` and `D`:\n\n```\ngit rebase --onto main feature-a feature-b\n```\n\nResult:\n\n```\nmain:       A---B\n                |\\\nfeature-a:      | C---D\n                 \\\nfeature-b:        E'---F'\n```\n\nGit took the commits in `feature-a..feature-b` (`E` and `F`) and replayed them onto `main`. A plain `git rebase main` from `feature-b` would have moved `C`, `D`, `E` and `F`, because all four are missing from `main`.\n\n## Other common uses\n\n- **Delete commits from the middle of a branch.** `git rebase --onto HEAD~3 HEAD~1` drops the 2nd and 3rd most recent commits and keeps the latest one.\n- **After the base branch was squashed or rebased.** `git rebase --onto main <old-base-sha>` replays only your own commits, so you don't re-apply the parent branch's old commits.\n\nRebasing rewrites commit hashes (`E'` \u2260 `E`). If the branch was already pushed, you'll need `git push --force-with-lease`."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 7204, "cache_read_input_tokens": 16780, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 7204}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "93c8944d-4841-477e-bf68-6bf00ae713b7", "uuid": "d2fa9cd2-6362-4277-a8f6-bed57102c443", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T15:33:18.966Z", "request_id": "req_011Cfbm3ZBgTFJx4H3RyPY1Y"}
